# Docker build-context hygiene for the SDK demo image (sdk/python/Dockerfile).
# The build only COPYs sdk/rust, mpc/wallet-mpc, and sdk/python/{pyproject.toml,README.md,paymos,examples};
# everything below is heavy junk that must NOT be uploaded to the daemon (this is a monorepo — without
# this the context is multiple GB of node_modules / Rust target / .NET bin+obj / venvs / .git).
.git
.superpowers/
.claude/

# JS / client
**/node_modules/
**/wwwroot/
**/.svelte-kit/
**/build/

# Rust
**/target/

# Python
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/dist/
**/*.whl
**/*.egg-info/

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/

# data / scratch
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3.*
**/*.log
